#: ../../tools/cath_tools.rst:61 bd0d94e4cb6a4b3cafbdd5bd311ede3c
msgid "**Name**: ``CATH_get_funfam``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/cath_tools.rst:63 c4c58b4a66cd4c4a80d82a39c5de45d0
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get details for a specific functional family (FunFam) "
"within a CATH superfamily. Returns FunFam name, description, member "
"count, seed alignment size, DOPS quality score, and representative domain"
" ID. FunFams represent groups of domains predicted to share the same "
"biological function. Use CATH\\_list\\_funfams to browse FunFams within a"
" superfamily, or CATH\\_get\\_domain\\_summary to find which FunFam a "
"specific domain belongs to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/cath_tools.rst:67 aaace2632ac0422699a3589f07dc1d4a
msgid ""
"``superfamily_id`` (string) (required) CATH superfamily ID (e.g., "
"'1.10.510.10')."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/cath_tools.rst:70 64fa4f105e7d4238a585f155ab36e4a2
msgid ""
"``funfam_number`` (string) (required) FunFam number within the "
"superfamily (e.g., '1', '83'). Get from CATH\\_list\\_funfams or "
"CATH\\_get\\_domain\\_summary."
msgstr ""

